WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.720
What happens when an AP Calculus&nbsp;
textbook is placed in SCP-914?

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.120
Dr. Hazard selected one AP Calculus&nbsp;
textbook for experimentation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.760
and placed it into the Clockworks on the setting,&nbsp;
"Rough." The output produced was a pile of large&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.080
shreds of plastic and paper. Two notes were&nbsp;
attached to the official experiment log.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.840
"Note: What? Don’t look at me like&nbsp;
that, school’s over - Dr. Hazard"

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.760
"Note: Hazard, if I catch you using 914&nbsp;
as your personal paper shredder again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:31.440
I'm reassigning you to Site-██. Yes,&nbsp;
the one on Antarctica. - Dr. Veritas"

